WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.833
Redact PDF: a quick tour.
Take words out of a PDF for good, not just cover them.

2
00:00:05.933 --> 00:00:11.933
Step 1 of 4: Mark what has to go
Drag over an area or words, or type a name and mark it on every page at once.

3
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:16.833
Step 2 of 4: Look the marks over
A mark is a red frame and takes nothing out yet. Press one to take it away again.

4
00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:22.400
Step 3 of 4: Apply
The letters, the pixels and the drawings under each mark leave the file. A black box shows where.

5
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.233
Step 4 of 4: Checked before you send it
Each place is read back. The download warns you if a mark was never applied.
